docs {
   # VarsityMart
   
   ## It is a platform where students trade their belongings, make deals and buy from each other or accredited stores around their campus
   
   ### Features 
   
   * Stores - Which Per-Semester an Individual subscribes to post more than 10 belongings.
   * Security - Stores and Individuals must register with proper documentation ( GhanaCard , NHIS card or Student ID card ) and registered emails or numbers
   * Delivery - Using Keber as the main delivery Service to deliver long distances or person-to-person for free
   * Seasonal Events (Exams or Mid-Sems) - We provide per University campus detailed pas examination questions by coursers, departments and colleges
}
